    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a moisture source in the landscape. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_moisture_source" kindref="compound">MoistureSource</ref> extends <ref refid="class_path_source" kindref="compound">PathSource</ref> and provides data on environmental moisture, temperature, and dynamics over time. It includes information on enemy-free and competitor-free space, as well as methods to update these dynamics per timestep. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
